        {
            name: "Reading Practice",
            easy: [
                "I love going to concerts. The music is wonderful. I always enjoy live performances.",
                "She paints beautiful pictures. Her artwork is amazing. Everyone loves her creativity.",
                "We watch movies every weekend. Cinema is our favorite activity. Films make us happy.",
                "He plays guitar in a band. They perform at local venues. Music is his passion.",
                "They visit art museums often. Exhibitions are very interesting. They learn about history.",
                "I buy tickets online. It's convenient and fast. I never miss good shows.",
                "She sings in a choir. Her voice is beautiful. Everyone enjoys her performances.",
                "We attend theater shows. The actors are talented. Drama excites us greatly.",
                "He directs independent films. His work is creative. Critics praise his vision.",
                "They create sculptures together. Art brings them joy. Their studio is inspiring.",
                "I practice piano daily. Music relaxes my mind. Playing improves my skills.",
                "She reads art reviews carefully. Information helps her choose. She discovers new artists.",
                "We enjoy cultural festivals. Events celebrate diversity. Music and art unite us.",
                "He dances at competitions. Movement expresses emotions. Dance is his language.",
                "They perform tonight. The show starts soon. Everyone is excited."
            ],
            medium: [
                "Going to museums is my favorite weekend activity. I always discover something new and interesting. Last Saturday I visited a contemporary art exhibition. The paintings were absolutely stunning and thought-provoking. I spent hours admiring each piece carefully.",
                "She dedicates every morning to practicing her violin. This consistent routine has improved her technique dramatically. Her music teacher says she has exceptional talent. Recently she performed a difficult concerto at a recital. Everyone in the audience was amazed by her skill.",
                "We subscribe to the local theater company. This gives us access to all their productions. Every month we attend at least two performances. The quality of acting is consistently excellent. Supporting local arts makes our community culturally richer.",
                "He spends weekends photographing street art. His camera captures incredible urban creativity. Last month he exhibited his best photographs. The gallery opening attracted many visitors. His work documents the city's evolving artistic landscape beautifully.",
                "They organize monthly jazz concerts. Musicians from around the country perform. The intimate venue creates a perfect atmosphere. Audience members can interact with artists. These events strengthen our local music community significantly.",
                "I collect contemporary paintings. Each piece tells a unique story. My collection represents diverse artistic styles. Visiting artists' studios helps me understand their creative process. Art investment provides both financial and aesthetic value.",
                "She choreographs modern dance performances. Her innovative movements challenge traditional boundaries. The dance company rehearses intensively. Every show explores important social themes. Audiences always leave feeling inspired and moved.",
                "We restore vintage movie posters. This specialized work preserves cinema history. Each project requires careful attention. We research the film's cultural context. Museums and collectors value our restoration expertise.",
                "He writes film criticism professionally. His insightful reviews influence viewers. Before writing, he watches movies multiple times. His analysis examines cinematography and storytelling. Many readers trust his recommendations.",
                "They teach pottery classes weekly. Students learn traditional and modern techniques. Creating with clay provides therapeutic benefits. The studio welcomes beginners enthusiastically. Artistic expression enriches everyone's life.",
                "I attend opera performances regularly. The combination of music and drama is powerful. Understanding different languages enhances appreciation. Last season featured several masterpieces. Opera represents the pinnacle of performing arts.",
                "She curates gallery exhibitions carefully. Selecting artists requires excellent judgment. Each show follows a coherent theme. Opening receptions attract art enthusiasts. Her work promotes emerging talent.",
                "We produce independent documentaries. Each film addresses important issues. Research and filming take many months. Distribution through festivals reaches audiences. Documentary filmmaking creates social awareness.",
                "He plays percussion in orchestra. Rhythm provides music's foundation. Years of practice developed his timing. Concert performances demand complete concentration. Musicians collaborate to create harmony.",
                "They preserve historical theaters. These buildings represent architectural heritage. Renovation work requires specialized craftspeople. Maintaining performance spaces benefits communities. Culture needs beautiful venues."
            ],
            hard: [
                "My passion for classical music began during childhood when my grandmother took me to symphony concerts regularly. I remember sitting in the grand concert hall, completely mesmerized by the orchestra's powerful sound. The way different instruments blended together created something magical that recordings could never fully capture. That early exposure shaped my lifelong appreciation for live performances. Now I attend concerts whenever possible, always choosing seats where I can observe the musicians' technique and expression closely.",
                "She has developed a distinctive painting style that combines traditional techniques with contemporary themes. Her artistic process begins with extensive research into historical art movements, particularly impressionism and expressionism. After gathering inspiration, she spends weeks sketching preliminary designs before touching canvas. Each painting requires multiple layers of oil paint applied carefully over several months. The result is work that captures modern life while honoring classical artistic traditions beautifully.",
                "We believe that arts education fundamentally enriches children's development beyond any other academic subject. Our nonprofit organization provides free music and art lessons to underprivileged youth throughout the city. Every afternoon, volunteer teachers work with students who might never otherwise access quality arts instruction. We've witnessed remarkable transformations as children discover creative talents and build confidence through artistic expression. Some students have even earned scholarships to prestigious arts schools, changing their life trajectories completely.",
                "He dedicates his career to preserving indigenous musical traditions that risk disappearing as older generations pass away. His fieldwork involves traveling to remote communities with recording equipment, documenting songs and stories from elderly musicians. These recordings get archived digitally and shared with younger community members who want to maintain their cultural heritage. The project requires sensitivity, patience, and deep respect for traditions. His work ensures that valuable musical knowledge survives for future generations to study and appreciate.",
                "They transform abandoned industrial spaces into vibrant arts districts that revitalize entire neighborhoods economically and culturally. Their development process involves identifying underutilized buildings with architectural character, then negotiating affordable leases for artists' studios and galleries. By creating clusters of creative activity, they attract restaurants, shops, and residents who value culture. Property values increase while maintaining affordability for working artists. This model demonstrates how arts investment generates sustainable urban renewal beyond conventional development approaches.",
                "I curate contemporary art exhibitions that challenge viewers to reconsider their assumptions about society and culture. Each exhibition begins with identifying a compelling theme that addresses current issues meaningfully. I then research artists whose work engages that theme from diverse perspectives. The selection process involves studio visits, reviewing portfolios, and lengthy discussions about artistic intentions. Installation requires careful attention to how pieces interact spatially. When successful, exhibitions create conversations that extend far beyond the gallery walls.",
                "She directs experimental theater productions that blend traditional dramatic techniques with multimedia technology and audience participation. Her rehearsal process encourages actors to improvise and contribute creatively rather than simply following scripts. Performances often incorporate video projections, interactive elements, and unconventional staging that transforms how audiences experience storytelling. Critics sometimes find her work controversial, but she believes theater must evolve to remain relevant for contemporary audiences. Each production pushes artistic boundaries while exploring timeless human themes.",
                "We operate a nonprofit documentary film festival that showcases stories often ignored by mainstream media and commercial entertainment. Our programming committee reviews thousands of submissions annually, selecting films that combine artistic excellence with social importance. The week-long festival brings filmmakers together with activists, scholars, and community members for screenings and discussions. These conversations often inspire collaborative action on issues featured in films. Documentary filmmaking has unique power to create empathy and motivate positive change.",
                "He researches the sociology of popular music, examining how musical tastes reflect and reinforce social identities and class divisions. His academic work analyzes how people use music to signal belonging to particular communities and distinguish themselves from others. Concert attendance, instrument preferences, and genre appreciation all carry social meanings that extend far beyond aesthetic judgments. His research reveals that musical taste is not simply personal preference but rather is shaped by education, family background, and social networks profoundly.",
                "They manage artist residency programs that provide creative professionals with time, space, and resources to develop ambitious new work without commercial pressures. Selected artists receive private studios, living accommodations, and stipends for several months. The program facilitates informal interactions among residents from different disciplines, encouraging unexpected collaborations. Many artists describe their residency experience as transformative, allowing them to take creative risks they couldn't afford otherwise. The program has launched numerous artistic careers and produced acclaimed work.",
                "I teach art history at the university, helping students understand how visual culture reflects and shapes human experience across time and geography. My courses examine not just famous masterpieces but also vernacular arts, crafts, and design that reveal how ordinary people lived. We analyze artworks as historical evidence, considering materials, techniques, symbolism, and cultural context. Students learn to look carefully, think critically, and articulate observations clearly. Art history education trains visual literacy skills increasingly important in our image-saturated world.",
                "She composes contemporary classical music that incorporates sounds from nature, urban environments, and electronic sources alongside traditional instruments. Her compositional process often begins with field recordings made in specific locations like forests or industrial sites. These sounds become raw material that she manipulates and combines with instrumental parts written for live musicians. Performances create immersive sonic experiences that blur boundaries between natural and artificial sounds. Her innovative work expands what audiences consider music while raising environmental awareness.",
                "We produce street theater performances in public spaces to make art accessible to people who might never enter traditional venues. Our mobile troupe performs in parks, bus stations, and marketplaces where diverse audiences gather naturally. These interventions surprise passersby and create moments of shared experience among strangers. Street theater has ancient roots but remains powerfully relevant for engaging communities and democratizing access to performance. Our work proves that art belongs everywhere, not just in expensive theaters.",
                "He photographs marginalized communities with the goal of challenging stereotypes and revealing human dignity often invisible in mainstream media. His documentary photography projects require years of relationship-building before communities trust him enough to document their lives authentically. The resulting images emphasize individual humanity rather than reducing people to social problems. Exhibitions in galleries and publications reach audiences who might never encounter these communities otherwise. His work demonstrates photography's potential for fostering empathy and social understanding.",
                "They advocate for increased public funding for arts education, arguing that creativity and cultural literacy are essential for democratic citizenship and economic innovation. Their research demonstrates that communities investing in arts programs experience measurable benefits including improved academic achievement, reduced crime, and increased civic engagement. Despite clear evidence, arts programs face constant budget cuts. Their advocacy work involves mobilizing artists, educators, and community members to influence policy decisions. Sustaining cultural vitality requires recognizing that arts funding is investment, not luxury spending."
        ]
    }]
},

