                "I prepare for exams / every evening. / Review is important. / Success requires effort.",
                "They write their thesis. / Research takes time. / Work continues daily. / Progress is steady.",
                "The lab is clean. / Equipment works well. / Results are clear. / Science is precise.",
                "I love learning. / It's so interesting. / I discover new things. / Education is wonderful.",
                "She conducts research / in the laboratory. / Data is collected. / Findings are recorded.",
                "We study chemistry. / We learn formulas. / Reactions are fascinating. / Science explains everything.",
