            medium: [
                "Every time I study / I take detailed notes. / I review them regularly / and remember everything important. / Learning becomes easier.",
                "At the university / we attend lectures daily. / We participate actively / and ask thoughtful questions. / Understanding improves constantly.",
                "In the laboratory / I conduct careful experiments. / I follow procedures exactly / and record all observations. / Research is systematic.",
                "She enjoys reading / scientific research papers. / She analyzes methodologies / and evaluates conclusions critically. / Knowledge deepens continuously.",
                "After graduating / we pursue doctoral degrees. / We conduct original research / and contribute new knowledge. / Now we're experts.",
                "I prefer studying physics / because it explains nature. / The mathematics is challenging / but extremely rewarding intellectually. / It's the best field.",
                "We explore the campus / between classes each day. / We visit different buildings / use various facilities / and meet interesting people.",
                "My favorite subject / is molecular biology now. / I study cellular processes / and understand life better. / Science is truly amazing.",
                "On Saturday mornings / we attend study groups. / The collaborative learning helps / with difficult concepts greatly. / Everyone benefits together.",
                "She researches genetics / before every class meeting. / She reads relevant articles / with scientific rigor always. / Preparation ensures success.",
                "I always keep / copies of my research data. / I back them up regularly / in multiple secure locations. / Better safe than sorry.",
                "We register for courses / several months beforehand. / It ensures seat availability / and preferred class schedules. / Early planning works best.",
                "He asks his professors / for research recommendations. / They know important resources / that students typically miss. / Their guidance is invaluable.",
                "My study partner / loves solving problems together. / She explains every step / from multiple perspectives clearly. / Teamwork enhances learning significantly.",
                "We usually spend / four years completing undergraduate. / It's sufficient time / to master fundamental concepts / without feeling rushed unnecessarily."
            ],
            hard: [
                "My academic research routine / starts months in advance. / I carefully review relevant literature / identify knowledge gaps / and formulate testable hypotheses. / I design rigorous experiments / select appropriate methodologies / and obtain necessary approvals / from ethics committees. / This preparation ensures validity / and produces meaningful results.",
                "Every laboratory experience / follows strict protocols exactly. / I arrive well prepared / with materials organized properly. / First I calibrate equipment / and verify measurements. / Then I conduct experiments carefully / documenting every observation. / At completion / I analyze data systematically / and draw evidence-based conclusions. / This methodical approach / prevents costly errors.",
                "During research seminars / I employ active listening strategies / to maximize learning outcomes. / I take comprehensive notes / and highlight key findings. / I ask clarifying questions / when concepts seem unclear. / I compare methodologies / across different studies carefully. / These habits transform seminars / into valuable learning experiences.",
                "Exploring scientific literature / requires sophisticated search strategies / and critical evaluation skills. / I access academic databases / and use targeted keywords. / I read abstracts first / to assess relevance quickly. / I analyze methodologies / and scrutinize statistical analyses. / This systematic approach / identifies high-quality research / and builds comprehensive understanding.",
                "Doctoral dissertation writing / demands extraordinary dedication / and exceptional time management. / I establish realistic timelines / with achievable milestones clearly defined. / I write consistently every day / regardless of motivation levels. / I seek regular feedback / from my advisory committee. / I revise drafts multiple times / until arguments become airtight. / This disciplined process / produces scholarly contributions / worthy of academic recognition.",
                "Conducting original research / is my greatest passion / in graduate school life. / I formulate novel hypotheses / based on literature gaps. / I design innovative experiments / using cutting-edge techniques. / I collect data meticulously / and perform rigorous analyses. / These research experiences / connect me with knowledge creation / more deeply than coursework / could ever possibly achieve.",
                "Collaborating with fellow researchers / enhances scientific productivity significantly / and accelerates knowledge advancement. / I attend regular meetings / and share preliminary findings. / I provide constructive feedback / on colleagues' research proposals. / I co-author manuscripts / when contributions warrant inclusion. / I mentor junior students / whenever opportunities arise. / Most researchers appreciate / when collaborators demonstrate professionalism / and maintain high ethical standards.",
                "Scientific conferences provide / invaluable networking opportunities continually. / I prepare compelling presentations / highlighting research significance. / I attend relevant sessions / and take detailed notes. / I engage researchers / during poster presentations actively. / I exchange contact information / with potential collaborators. / These professional interactions / help establish my reputation / long after graduate school / when seeking academic positions.",
                "Balancing coursework and research / requires strategic planning constantly. / I create detailed schedules / allocating time appropriately. / I prioritize dissertation work / over less critical tasks. / I communicate regularly / with my academic advisor. / I maintain work-life boundaries / preventing complete burnout. / These management strategies / extend research productivity / throughout the demanding years / of doctoral education successfully.",
                "Pursuing academic publishing / needs persistence and resilience / when facing inevitable rejections. / I carefully select target journals / matching research scope appropriately. / I follow submission guidelines meticulously / and write clear abstracts. / I respond professionally / to peer review feedback. / I revise manuscripts thoroughly / addressing all concerns raised. / This professional approach / increases publication success / and builds academic credibility significantly.",
                "Teaching undergraduate students / while conducting doctoral research / develops essential communication skills effectively. / I prepare engaging lectures / explaining complex concepts clearly. / I create interactive activities / promoting active learning always. / I provide constructive feedback / on student assignments regularly. / I hold accessible office hours / encouraging student questions freely. / These teaching experiences / complement research training / and prepare me for faculty positions.",
                "Laboratory safety protocols / are absolutely essential / when conducting experimental research. / I wear appropriate protective equipment / at all times required. / I handle hazardous materials / following established procedures carefully. / I dispose of waste / according to regulations strictly. / I report accidents immediately / to safety officers. / These careful practices / protect everyone working / in shared research spaces.",
